    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits-measurement-growth-dilution-slope-d-sigma-eff-d-rho-of-the-q-c-turing-mode> a schema:PropertyValue,
